cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Giolit SystemVerilog Assertion Verifier
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-13
abstract: Formal proof that SystemVerilog assertions hold for all inputs
  and every start state — or the exact clock cycle that breaks them. Verifier,
  C++ SDK, benchmarks and result evidence. Signed proof certificates and
  safety margins with the Giolit Safety Resilience Score.
